{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/SimulatedPaywallService"},"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"actor"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"SimulatedPaywallService"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use this as the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"service:"},{"type":"text","text":" while the paywall vendor decision is still open."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It behaves like a micro version of the real thing: entitlement changes are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"pushed through "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/SimulatedPaywallService\/customerInfoStream()","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" so they flow through the real"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PaywallPlugin"},{"type":"text","text":" pipeline and survive later refresh\/restore — exactly as a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"RevenueCat\/StoreKit service would."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The simulation surface ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"grantPro()"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"setRestoreShouldFail(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":", …) is not"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"part of "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/PaywallService","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"; the dev paywall UI in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SwiduxDevPaywallUI"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"drives it. Hold a single instance and pass it to both "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Store.configured()"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".devPaywall(...)"},{"type":"text","text":" view."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EntitlementSnapshot"},{"type":"text","text":" only models "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isPro"},{"type":"text","text":" \/ "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"hasPermanentLicense"},{"type":"text","text":", so a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"“trial” yields "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isPro == true"},{"type":"text","text":" and is distinguished only in the log line."}]},{"type":"aside","style":"warning","name":"Warning","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This service simulates purchases — nothing is charged and no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"receipt exists. Release builds are supported so TestFlight\/QA can drive"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the paywall vendor-free, but the service logs a fault at init in Release"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"as a submission tripwire: replace it with a real "},{"code":"PaywallService","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" before"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"shipping to the App Store."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A stateful, fully driveable "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/PaywallService"},{"type":"text","text":" for development and QA."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall"]]},"metadata":{"symbolKind":"class","title":"SimulatedPaywallService","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"actor"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"SimulatedPaywallService"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"SimulatedPaywallService","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"SwiduxPaywall"}],"externalID":"s:13SwiduxPaywall09SimulatedB7ServiceC","